{"id":"2d637eeb7f7194f4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/756_Common_Logic.md","title":"756 Common Logic","display":"756_Common_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"756-Common-Logic\">756 Common Logic</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-来源、片段与名字\">1. 来源、片段与名字</h1>\n<p>固定 ISO/IEC 24707:2007 §6 的非分隔、无序列标记、无模块、无注释句核心；不取非论域名字或序列变量。本文件保留 CL 的共享指称及可变参数长度机制。<a href=\"https://standards.iteh.ai/catalog/standards/iso/192b470e-c232-4423-95e5-62061c892312/iso-iec-24707-2007\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">标准版本和解释条件</a>。下面给出该片段的全部本地语法、操作和模型，不把普通固定元数 FOL 签名充作 CL 名字表。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 为可数名字集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 不交的变量标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N)\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in N\">\\(n\\in N\\)</span> 都可出现在名字项、函数头或关系头位置；不按这三种用途分成互斥名字种类，不给名字固定元数。变量标签是标准化绑定位置的本地表示；项变量也能占据函数头和关系头。</p>\n<p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,\\qquad m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,\\qquad m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项\">2. 项</h1>\n<p>全部构造子是互异标签的有限形成树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span> 是满足以下条款的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(n)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(n)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in N\">\\(n\\in N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:k\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(\\tau:k\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}\">\\(\\operatorname{app}\\)</span> 的精确域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。函数头本身是项，允许名字、变量或复合项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 取空参数列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-公式\">3. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span> 是满足以下条款的最小形成树集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(u,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(u,\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{not}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{not}(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ex}(x,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{ex}(x,A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>纯显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=t\">\\(s=t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(\\tau(0),\\ldots,\\tau(k-1))\">\\(u(\\tau(0),\\ldots,\\tau(k-1))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B\">\\(A\\wedge B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\vee B\">\\(A\\vee B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x A\">\\(\\forall x A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x A\">\\(\\exists x A\\)</span>；项的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau)\\)</span> 显示为带项类别的同样应用形状，语法类别区分项应用与关系原子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-自由与绑定变量\">4. 自由与绑定变量</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\operatorname{name}(n))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\operatorname{name}(n))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_T(u)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\tau(i)),\\quad k=\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_T(u)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\tau(i)),\\quad k=\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_F(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))=\\operatorname{FV}_T(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_T(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_F(\\operatorname{rel}(u,\\tau))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_T(u)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_F(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))=\\operatorname{FV}_T(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_T(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_F(\\operatorname{rel}(u,\\tau))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_T(u)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}_T(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_F(\\operatorname{not}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_F(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_F(Q(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_F(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_F(B)\n\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_F(\\operatorname{not}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_F(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_F(Q(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_F(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_F(B)\n\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_F(Q(x,A))=\\operatorname{FV}_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{ex}\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_F(Q(x,A))=\\operatorname{FV}_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{ex}\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项不含绑定构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_F\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_F\\)</span> 在 eq／rel 上为空，not 分支取子式绑定集，三个二元布尔分支取两子式绑定集之并，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_F(Q(x,A))=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_F(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_F(Q(x,A))=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_F(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-替换、改名与-α-等价\">5. 替换、改名与 α 等价</h1>\n<p>变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x:=s]\">\\([x:=s]\\)</span> 固定名字项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=s]\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=s]\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=x\">\\(y=x\\)</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(y)\\)</span>。它作用于所有项位置，包括函数头和关系头：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{app}(u[x:=s],\\tau&#39;),\\quad\n\\operatorname{rel}(u,\\tau)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{rel}(u[x:=s],\\tau&#39;),\n\\quad\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=s].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{app}(u[x:=s],\\tau&#39;),\\quad\n\\operatorname{rel}(u,\\tau)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{rel}(u[x:=s],\\tau&#39;),\n\\quad\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=s].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>eq 的两项、not 的子式、imp／and／or 的两子式逐分量替换。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{ex}\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{ex}\\}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(y,A)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nQ(y,A),&amp;y=x,\\\\\nQ(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_T(s),\\\\\nQ(z,(A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(y,A)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nQ(y,A),&amp;y=x,\\\\\nQ(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_T(s),\\\\\nQ(z,(A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_F(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_F(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_F(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_F(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。这是按公式大小和新鲜改名定义的捕获避免递归。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span> 上满足构造相容性且包含\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q(x,A),Q(y,A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]))\">\\((Q(x,A),Q(y,A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]))\\)</span> 的全部等价关系之交，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=(\\operatorname{Sub}_T,\\operatorname{Sub}_F)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=(\\operatorname{Sub}_T,\\operatorname{Sub}_F)\\)</span> 为上述两个总替换函数。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-公理集合\">6. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{bool}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{quant}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{bool}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{quant}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A),\\ (A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A),\\ (A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{bool}=\\{A\\wedge B\\to A,\\ A\\wedge B\\to B,\\ A\\to(A\\vee B),\\ B\\to(A\\vee B),\\ (\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{bool}=\\{A\\wedge B\\to A,\\ A\\wedge B\\to B,\\ A\\to(A\\vee B),\\ B\\to(A\\vee B),\\ (\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{quant}=\\{(\\forall x A)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to(\\exists x A):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{quant}=\\{(\\forall x A)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to(\\exists x A):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}=\\{t=t,\\ (s=t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}},x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}=\\{t=t,\\ (s=t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}},x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-规则与证明\">7. 规则与证明</h1>\n<p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{mp}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{mp}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{gen}=\\{((A),\\forall x A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{gen}=\\{((A),\\forall x A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{CL}} B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{CL}} B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令总规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{mp}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{gen}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{alpha}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{mp}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{gen}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{alpha}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>。从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(p=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<p>以下第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 个条件逐一、分别定义谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\ell(\\Gamma,p,i)\">\\(L_\\ell(\\Gamma,p,i)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq\\ell\\leq 5\">\\(1\\leq\\ell\\leq 5\\)</span>）；每行至少满足其中一个条件。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{mp}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{mp}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\operatorname{all}(x,A_j)\">\\(A_i=\\operatorname{all}(x,A_j)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{gen}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{gen}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_F(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_F(G)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{alpha}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{alpha}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可的唯一组合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,p,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{5} L_\\ell(\\Gamma,p,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,p,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{5} L_\\ell(\\Gamma,p,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本节的证明条件是对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,p,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,p,i)\\)</span>；本节定义的证明对象、证明谓词及可导出关系均采用此条件。序列须非空、有限且逐行有型；末项条件和各分支的严格早索引条件同时保留。</p>\n<p>定义证明谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,p,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,p,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是满足上述条件且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CL}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CL}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,p,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,p,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-局部语义载体与语义后承\">9. 局部语义载体与语义后承</h1>\n<p>本片段取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"UR=UD=D\">\\(UR=UD=D\\)</span>。结构类谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists D,\\operatorname{int},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel}\\ (\nM=(D,\\operatorname{int},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel})\\land D\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{int}:N\\to D\n\\land\\operatorname{fun}:D\\to(D^{&lt;\\omega}\\to D)\n\\land\\operatorname{rel}:D\\to\\mathcal P(D^{&lt;\\omega})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists D,\\operatorname{int},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel}\\ (\nM=(D,\\operatorname{int},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel})\\land D\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{int}:N\\to D\n\\land\\operatorname{fun}:D\\to(D^{&lt;\\omega}\\to D)\n\\land\\operatorname{rel}:D\\to\\mathcal P(D^{&lt;\\omega})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里函数型断言指 ZFC 集合函数；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span> 都有唯一函数扩张和关系扩张，覆盖所有有限参数长度。同一名字或共指名字共享同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的这两个扩张；没有名字的元数限制。对每个模型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Asg}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)=D^{\\mathsf{Var}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Asg}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)=D^{\\mathsf{Var}}\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[x:=d]\">\\(g[x:=d]\\)</span> 为通常单点更新。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{var}(x)⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=g(x),\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{name}(n)⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=\\operatorname{int}(n),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{var}(x)⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=g(x),\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{name}(n)⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=\\operatorname{int}(n),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau)⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\n=\\operatorname{fun}(⟦ u⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}})(\\bar d),\n\\qquad \\bar d(i)=⟦\\tau(i)⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\quad(i&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{app}(u,\\tau)⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\n=\\operatorname{fun}(⟦ u⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}})(\\bar d),\n\\qquad \\bar d(i)=⟦\\tau(i)⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\quad(i&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ s⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=⟦ t⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ s⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}=⟦ t⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\operatorname{rel}(u,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bar d\\in\\operatorname{rel}(⟦ u⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\operatorname{rel}(u,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bar d\\in\\operatorname{rel}(⟦ u⟧^{M,g}_{\\operatorname{CL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>not、imp、and、or 的满足分别取元层否定、蕴涵、合取、析取；all／ex 满足为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall d\\in D\\ M,g[x:=d]\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}A,\n\\quad\nM,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\operatorname{ex}(x,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in D\\ M,g[x:=d]\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall d\\in D\\ M,g[x:=d]\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}A,\n\\quad\nM,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\operatorname{ex}(x,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in D\\ M,g[x:=d]\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有全模型表达式是 ZFC 类模式：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\">\\(M\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\,P\">\\(\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\,P\\)</span> 展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall M(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\Rightarrow P)\">\\(\\forall M(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\Rightarrow P)\\)</span>；满足为模型、赋值、公式之间的可定义类关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models^{sem}_{\\operatorname{CL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall M(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\Rightarrow\n\\forall g\\in\\mathsf{Asg}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\n((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}G)\\Rightarrow M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models^{sem}_{\\operatorname{CL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall M(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\Rightarrow\n\\forall g\\in\\mathsf{Asg}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\n((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}G)\\Rightarrow M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例也是类谓词，不能集合化：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fail}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,A;c)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M,g\\ (c=(M,g)\\land\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\land\ng\\in\\mathsf{Asg}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\land\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}G)\\land M,g\\not\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Fail}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,A;c)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M,g\\ (c=(M,g)\\land\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\land\ng\\in\\mathsf{Asg}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(M)\\land\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ M,g\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}G)\\land M,g\\not\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RefuteCert}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,A,c)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Fail}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,A;c),\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\models^{sem}_{\\operatorname{CL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists c\\ \\operatorname{RefuteCert}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,A,c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RefuteCert}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,A,c)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Fail}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,A;c),\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\models^{sem}_{\\operatorname{CL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists c\\ \\operatorname{RefuteCert}_{\\operatorname{CL}}(\\Gamma,A,c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一个具体反例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是集合对；全体反例使用上式模式。项／公式同时归纳给出替换引理，应用头也纳入归纳；由此第 6 节量词、等号模式及第 7 节带假设自由变量守卫的规则保持本节满足。这里只给该演算，不另声称完备性。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-来源对应与特征差异\">10. 来源对应与特征差异</h1>\n<p>到所选 CL 核心的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>：name(n) 映到 discourse name n，var(x) 映到环境绑定的 discourse name x，app(u,τ) 映到以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(u)\">\\(T(u)\\)</span> 为 operator、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\circ\\tau\">\\(T\\circ\\tau\\)</span> 为有限 argument sequence 的 functional term，rel(u,τ) 映到相同头与参数的 atom；等号和布尔构造逐项映射，all／ex 映到单个绑定名字的相应 quantified sentence。映射在带类别形成树上单射到所选标准化片段，逆映射按相同构造读取。标准解释限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"UR=UD\">\\(UR=UD\\)</span> 且无序列标记时，恰给出本节 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D,int,fun,rel)\">\\((D,int,fun,rel)\\)</span>；反向扩张的序列标记映射是空函数。逐树归纳得项值和满足相等。这是本地语义保持对应，不依赖另一笔记定义。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Delta}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\n=(N,\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\operatorname{fun}:D\\to(D^{&lt;\\omega}\\to D),\n\\operatorname{rel}:D\\to\\mathcal P(D^{&lt;\\omega})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Delta}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\n=(N,\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}}^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\operatorname{fun}:D\\to(D^{&lt;\\omega}\\to D),\n\\operatorname{rel}:D\\to\\mathcal P(D^{&lt;\\omega})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上式记录共享名字、项头和所有有限元数解释的接口型别。可核对：同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in N\">\\(p\\in N\\)</span> 既形成 name(p)，又形成 app(name(p),())，并形成 rel(name(p),(name(p))) 和 rel(name(p),(name(p),name(p)))；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\\operatorname{rel}(\\operatorname{var}(x),(\\operatorname{name}(p)))\">\\(\\forall x\\,\\operatorname{rel}(\\operatorname{var}(x),(\\operatorname{name}(p)))\\)</span> 允许对关系头的指称量化。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{CL}}=(\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Var},\\operatorname{fresh},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\operatorname{FV}_T,\\operatorname{FV}_F,\\operatorname{BV}_F,\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL},T,\\operatorname{Delta}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{mp},\\mathsf{Rule}_{gen},\\mathsf{Rule}_{alpha},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\mathsf{Asg}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\n⟦-⟧_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\models^{sem}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\n\\operatorname{Fail}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\operatorname{RefuteCert}_{\\operatorname{CL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{CL}}=(\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Var},\\operatorname{fresh},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\operatorname{FV}_T,\\operatorname{FV}_F,\\operatorname{BV}_F,\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL},T,\\operatorname{Delta}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{mp},\\mathsf{Rule}_{gen},\\mathsf{Rule}_{alpha},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\mathsf{Asg}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\n⟦-⟧_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\models_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\models^{sem}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\n\\operatorname{Fail}_{\\operatorname{CL}},\\operatorname{RefuteCert}_{\\operatorname{CL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>此元组是有限元层接口记录；类坐标存其定义公式，Delta 中的模型型别是模式，不把全体任意域模型或真类作为 ZFC 集合元组元素。系统覆盖上述精确 CL 核心、有限证明和反例模式；序列标记、非论域名字、模块和 CLIF 具体记号超出本片段。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"756-Common-Logic","text":"756 Common Logic","level":1},{"id":"1.-来源、片段与名字","text":"1. 来源、片段与名字","level":1},{"id":"2.-项","text":"2. 项","level":1},{"id":"3.-公式","text":"3. 公式","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由与绑定变量","text":"4. 自由与绑定变量","level":1},{"id":"5.-替换、改名与-α-等价","text":"5. 替换、改名与 α 等价","level":1},{"id":"6.-公理集合","text":"6. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"7.-规则与证明","text":"7. 规则与证明","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导出关系","text":"8. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-局部语义载体与语义后承","text":"9. 局部语义载体与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"10.-来源对应与特征差异","text":"10. 来源对应与特征差异","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(N)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in N","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Va